{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n台慶劇《璀璨之城》中，張智霖弒父一幕清唱《Que Será, Será》嚇壞觀眾，但原來這首歌並非普通版本！劇組專誠為其角色度身訂造「極暗黑版」，歌詞與編曲充滿詭異巧思，究竟這首心寒之歌隱藏了官孝賢甚麼不為人知的內心世界？不少網民直呼聽到起晒雞皮，成功為劇情增添恐怖氣氛。\n</p>\n<h2>張智霖「乾涸心寒版」清唱響起 劇組緊接播「極暗黑版本」</h2>\n<p>在昨晚（26日）播出的弒父重頭戲中，音樂的運用可謂功不可沒。當張智霖飾演的孝賢慢條斯理地準備送父親上路時，他以極度陰沉的哽咽式氣聲，現場清唱出「乾涸心寒版」的《Que Será, Será》，這個處理大大增加了畫面的心寒度。而為了將張力推至頂點，當他清唱完畢後，劇集隨即緊接播放時長約1分半鐘、由他親自演繹的「極暗黑版本」插曲，詭異的編曲配上空洞的環境聲，令心寒指數暴升至頂點。</p>\n<h2>揭《Que Será, Será》度身訂造內幕 詭異編曲配心寒演繹</h2>\n<p>為了讓劇情及角色更立體，劇組專誠為《璀璨之城》的插曲《Que Será, Será》重新改編，歌詞更是為官孝賢這個角色度身訂造，配以詭異的編曲及張智霖心寒的聲音演繹，極度有Feel。整個音樂設計旨在配合該場戲的陰森感與張力，從張智霖的現場清唱，到後期製作的「極暗黑版本」緊接播放，層層遞進，完美地透過音樂深化了角色的瘋狂與悲情，難怪不少網民表示聽到毛骨悚然。</p>\n<h2>《璀璨》版《Que Será, Será》改編歌詞全公開</h2>\n<p>劇組為孝賢度身訂造的《璀璨》版《Que Será, Será 》改編歌詞如下：</p>\n<p>When I was just a little boy I asked my father, “What will I be?”<br/>\n“Will I be handsome? Will I be rich?”<br/>\nHere’s what he said to me<br/>\n“Que Será, Será Whatever will be, will be”<br>\n“The future’s not ours to see. ＂<br/>\n“Que Será, Será What will be, will be”</br></p>\n<p>When I grew up and fell in love, I ask my sweetheart What lies ahead<br/>\nWill we have rainbows day after day?<br/>\nHere’s what sweetheart said<br/>\n“Que Será, Será Whatever will be, will be”<br/>\n“The future’s not ours to see.”<br/>\n“Que Será, Será What will be, will be”</p>\n<p>“Que Será, Será What will be, will be”</p>\n<h2>網民直呼聽到起雞皮：呢首歌以後有陰影！</h2>\n<p>這首度身訂造的「極暗黑版」《Que Será, Será》成功引起網民熱議，不少人直呼聽到起晒雞皮，認為歌曲的運用是神來之筆。網民留言：「原本係首好普通嘅歌，而家完全唔同晒，好心寒！」、「歌詞配埋個畫面，真係絕！完全感受到孝賢嘅絕望。」、「Chilam把聲好恐怖，但又好好聽，好矛盾！」、「以後喺街聽到《Que Será, Será》都會諗起呢一幕，有陰影喇！」、「神級配樂！將成場戲昇華到另一個層次。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_6385863016ae0398e7f631.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_6385863016ae0398e7f631.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_19010242956ae0399234e49.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_19010242956ae0399234e49.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/36_2725493566ae03995890c6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/36_2725493566ae03995890c6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_16967063046ae03998d1bfd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_16967063046ae03998d1bfd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/38_8954375576ae0399b4788b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/38_8954375576ae0399b4788b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/39_9773870476ae0399dc9c71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/39_9773870476ae0399dc9c71.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:01:48.237949+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1672,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:43:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:42.650874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:58:44.610394+00:00","content_hash":"d7904e298ab786e65b045b661a49ec52e42eeb901b0a6fe7c6217be3fc88d4cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}